  "summary": "Malicious code in vl-ui-cookie-statement (npm)",
  "details": "Vl-ui-cookie-statement@1.0.0 is an empty placeholder package published under a name that mimics the vl-ui component library family. The tarball contains only a package.json and a 55-byte index.js consisting of a single comment line; there are no lifecycle hooks, no dependencies, no executable code, and no network activity. The package ships no functional implementation and appears intended to squat on the vl-ui naming namespace rather than provide any real functionality.",
